AV1 film grain synthesis

The Rust implementation in src/grain/{lfsr,template,scaling,offsets,cpu}.rs,
its parameter representation in src/grain/params.rs, the AV1 Gaussian
sequence in src/grain/gaussian.rs, and the pixel shaders in
shaders/grain_{luma,chroma}_ps.hlsl derive from dav1d 1.5.4, commit
54706fc6bc0cdecab7e9593974a4039cc038fca7:
https://code.videolan.org/videolan/dav1d

